rule purchase_ja_form v1
description "What ringi writes from the form of purchase.ja.ringi: the totals and computations, and when a field is shown and asked for"

elements lines
  quantity : number  range >=1 <=10_000
  price    : money[円]  range >=1円 <=50_000_000円

define subtotal : money[円] = quantity * price  range >=1円 <=100_000_000円

sum amount over lines of subtotal  range >=1円 <=100_000_000円

outputs
  amount : money[円]  round down(1円)
